{
  "slug": "oh-my-obsidian",
  "name": "Oh My Obsidian",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Claude Code를 위한 영구적인 '두 번째 뇌(Second Brain)'입니다.\n\noh-my-obsidian은 로컬 Obsidian Vault와 Claude Code를 직접 연결하여 AI 에이전트의 가장 큰 취약점인 '문맥 단절(Amnesia)'을 해결합니다. 과거의 아키텍처 의사결정 내역을 자동으로 기록(session-save)하고, 유사한 이슈 발생 시 관련 컨텍스트를 즉시 인출(recall)하여 대화에 다시 통합합니다.\n\n소크라테스식 인터뷰를 기반으로 한 초기 폴더 설계(setup)부터 방대해진 문서 트리를 꼬임 없이 안전하게 재구조화하는 리팩토링(refactor) 기능까지, 내장된 특수 서브 에이전트(Vault Architect 등)들이 개발 팀의 완벽한 로컬 지식베이스 구축을 돕습니다. 자동 Git 동기화 스크립트 기능이 포함되어 새로운 팀원의 지식 온보딩도 단 몇 초 만에 완료됩니다.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**, **5 agents**, **7 commands**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `obsidian-vault-manager` (Manage the Obsidian vault structure, organize documents, add new files, and maintain the team's knowledge base), `recall` (Automatically recall relevant past context from the Obsidian vault when the user asks about past decisions, previous work,…), `session-save` (Save current session context and work summary to the Obsidian vault when the user asks to record or…)\n- **Agents** (5): `migration-verifier` (Expert at validating file and directory migration plans, ensuring no data loss or overwrite conflicts occur during vault…), `socratic-interviewer` (Expert at conducting Socratic interviews to clarify vault setup requirements — asks focused questions, never builds), `transcript-summarizer` (Expert at reading Claude Code session transcripts and extracting structured summaries with decisions, errors, and action items), `vault-architect` (Expert at designing Obsidian vault structures for team knowledge management, categorizing information, and organizing document hierarchies), `vault-auditor` (Expert at analyzing existing Obsidian vault structures and conducting Socratic interviews to identify pain points and refactoring needs)\n- **Commands** (7): `enable-auto-save` (Enable automatic session save on exit (Registers SessionEnd hook)), `recall` (Search and recall past documents, decisions, and troubleshooting from the vault), `refactor` (Interactive vault refactoring wizard to reorganize an existing Obsidian vault), `restore-history` (과거 Claude Code / Codex 세션 기록을 vault에 구조화된 문서로 복원), `session-save` (Save current session context and work summary to the vault), `setup` (Interactive setup wizard for Obsidian vault integration), `vault` (Manage Obsidian vault — list contents, add documents, organize structure)\n- **Hooks** (1): `Stop`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `.mcp.json`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install oh-my-obsidian@claude-community` from `hongdangmoo49/oh-my-obsidian`.",
